        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/alabama_ladonia",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1880 settlers founded the New Hope Missionary Baptist Church, which became the community’s central hub for worship.",
